    "question": {
      ":question/id": "f49e4c8f-f10a-51ff-bfef-3f0ecd80cb50",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $(A+B)-(C+U)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$(A+B)-(C+U)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Calculate each parenthesized result entry by entry:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+(-3) & 3+3 \\\\ 5+2 & 2+5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+U & =\\begin{bmatrix}2+0 & 0+(-2) \\\\ -1+(-5) & -3+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\\\ -6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-(C+U) & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\\\ -6 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0-2 & 6-(-2) \\\\ 7-(-6) & 7-(-2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 8 \\\\ 13 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
