    "question": {
      ":question/id": "5e66849b-5bdb-5505-a153-3a13c0a973da",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $(A+B)-(C-U)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -5 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$(A+B)-(C-U)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Calculate each parenthesized result entry by entry:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+(-1) & -2+(-2) \\\\ -3+(-2) & 3+(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-U & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-(-4) & -5-(-5) \\\\ -2-4 & -1-2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ -6 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-(C-U) & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ -6 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2-3 & -4-0 \\\\ -5-(-6) & 2-(-3)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
