    "question": {
      ":question/id": "f597b375-5a7f-58d7-a120-f59c1b536550",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $(C-D)-(E+U)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$(C-D)-(E+U)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Calculate each parenthesized result entry by entry:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-D & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5-(-1) & -1-3 \\\\ 5-(-2) & -4-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -4 \\\\ 7 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}E+U & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+4 & -5+5 \\\\ 1+1 & 5+(-3)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(C-D)-(E+U) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -4 \\\\ 7 & -8\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4-8 & -4-0 \\\\ 7-2 & -8-2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & -4 \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
